        <name>SAME_MIDPOINT_DIST_THRESHOLD</name>
        <initializer>= 0.2</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>If two midpoints have a distance (between each other) of less than <emphasis>SAME_MIDPOINT_DIST_THRESHOLD</emphasis> meters, it will be considered to be the same point. </para>
